{
  "markdown": "<!-- docx-story: body body -->\n\n<!-- docx-export:0 -->\nHarbor water-saving pilot\n\n<!-- docx-export:1 -->\nDecision: extend the pilot to Pier B on 15 October 2026. Owner: Mira. The chart is evidence, not decoration.\n\n<!-- docx-export:2 -->\n| <!-- docx-export:3 -->Site | <!-- docx-export:4 -->Before | <!-- docx-export:5 -->After |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| <!-- docx-export:6 -->Pier A | <!-- docx-export:7 -->120 L/day | <!-- docx-export:8 -->72 L/day |\n| <!-- docx-export:9 -->Pier B | <!-- docx-export:10 -->Pending | <!-- docx-export:11 -->Pending |\n\n<!-- docx-export:12 -->\nWater use before and after\n\n<!-- docx-export:13 -->\n![120 to 72 litres/day, a 40% reduction]()\n\n<!-- docx-export:14 -->\nSame chart for operations handoff\n\n<!-- docx-export:15 -->\n![Same chart for operations handoff]()\n\n<!-- docx-export:16 -->\n<!-- docx-unsupported: c:chart -->\n\n<!-- docx-story: hf:rId9 header -->\n\n<!-- docx-export:17 -->\nInternal synthetic briefing — review date 12 October 2026\n\n<!-- docx-story: hf:rId10 footer -->\n\n<!-- docx-export:18 -->\nFooter constraint: budget capped at EUR 4,000.\n",
